OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear skies
OL,6,Fand light winds to begin the evening.
OL,7,FWidespread mist and fog forming
OL,8,Fovernight in the early hours,
OL,9,Fparticularly across the east of the
OL,10,Fregion to begin with but spreading
OL,11,Fwest by the morning. Chillier than of
OL,12,Flate.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FFog and low cloud generally
OL,15,Fclearing, but perhaps lingering all
OL,16,Fday in places, with another dry and
OL,17,Fbright day. Mild in the sunshine but
OL,18,Fchilly where it stays foggy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
